title: "Frobenius certificates for the Galois group of x(x-1)...(x-p+1)+1"
authors:
  - name: "Open"
type: software
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: v1.3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/bigjokker/galois-fp"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22135245
abstract: >-
  Certificates for the symmetric Galois group of a prime-degree falling
  factorial plus one, reduced discriminants, periodic congruence coverage,
  finite certificate data, and a critical-window theorem for (x)_p+c.
  The all-prime identification remains a conjecture. Version v1.3.0
  supersedes the archived v1.2.0 claims.
